 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/11/15 14:24| 02 | 095| 016| 0931| 0595| 0130| 1757|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/11/15 10:36| 01 | 040| 006| 0594| 0085| 0534| 0730|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/11/15 08:00| 01 | 050| 014| 0256| 0047| 0177| 0342|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/11/15 01:36| 01 | 069| 012| 0243| 0094| 0120| 0368|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/11/14 23:36| 01 | 281| 008| 1562| 0410| 0744| 1835|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/11/14 23:36| 02 | 220| 030| 133"
